 "不可養寵物"}]}, "preference": {"title": "優選理由", "active": 0, "footnote": "", "data": []}, "remark": {"title": "屋況介紹", "key": "remark", "active": 1, "content": "<p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 29px; color: black;\"><strong>🏡新北市政府社會住宅包租代管計畫🏡</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br><br></span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 27px; color: red;\">📢免服務費!!&nbsp;免服務費!!&nbsp;免服務費!!</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: red;\">可報稅、可入戶籍、可申請租補（租補金額試算，請上營建署的300億擴大中央租金補貼申請試算表）</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">※禁神明廳、禁寵物、禁菸</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">※管理費另計&nbsp;$1000</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">【來電預約看屋前，請先確認符合以下資格】</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">🎈申請資格🎈</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">◆&nbsp;<strong>一般戶：</strong></span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">(1)&nbsp;年滿18歲（含）以上或未滿18歲已結婚之中華民國國民</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">(2)&nbsp;月均收$62,125元以下</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">(3)&nbsp;家庭成員均無位於雙北、基隆、桃園40平方公尺(12坪)以上自有住宅</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">(4)&nbsp;家庭成員均無承租本市國民住宅、公共（營）住宅、社會住宅者</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">(5)&nbsp;動產限額471萬，不動產限額708萬</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">(6)&nbsp;需在國內設有戶籍</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">(7)&nbsp;申請日前一個月內，財政部國稅局查調之申請人及家庭成員全國財產稅總歸戶查詢清單</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">(8)&nbsp;申請日前一個月內，財政部國稅局查調之申請人及家庭成員綜合所得稅各類所得資料清單</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">▲符合以上條件需準備▲</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">1、承租人國民身分證影本</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">2、全戶戶籍謄本（現戶全戶&詳細記事）&nbsp;/&nbsp;申請日前1個月內之有效期限(戶政事務所申請)</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br><br></span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">3、其他身分證明文件</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: black;\">※家庭成員定義→含申請人、申請人之配偶、戶籍內之直系親屬及其配偶、與申請人或配偶為同戶籍之未成年子女(限18歲以下)</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: black;\"><br><br></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 19px;\">📱預約專線：</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size: 19px; color: rgb(5, 5, 5);\">0903-210-333蔡小姐</span><br><br><br><br><span style=\"color: rgb(74, 74, 74); background-color: white;\">廿一世紀資產管理股份有限公司不動產經紀人:官玉珍(91)北市經登字第00538號00</span></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、公園綠地、學校。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "摩天31 淡水區中山北路一段255號", "lat": "25.1808190", "lng": "121.4444770", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic